"Next stop," says a voice over the loudspeaker.
This is a large station.
I must change trains here.
The U-Bahn stops.
I get out of the U-Bahn.
The large hall is very busy.
Many people are walking through the hall.
I follow the green signs for the S-Bahn.
The platform for the S-Bahn lies upstairs.
I must go up the stairs.
Upstairs I am outside again.
I arrive at the platform.
My S-Bahn is already standing there!
The doors are still open.
I must travel with the S-Bahn.
I must be fast.
My backpack is heavy, but I run the last metres.
I quickly get into the train.
Then the doors close.
